  "reviewNotes": "Advanced: consent is enforced for partners but skipped by system tokens (subtle); de-identified data keeps quasi-identifiers (subtle). Present controls that do not apply to a path: consent checks (system tokens), MDM (browser on unmanaged phones), anomaly rules (system reads excluded), no-egress (output review)."
}
